        "cooked": "<p>So according to <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/content/oversized-cards-and-promos-and-panels\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a> image, Jim took his hat off  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=9\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\">  and Writhe took his hat off  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=9\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"> …</p>\n<p>Also, I can't believe they convinced Mainstay to put this outfit on!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>\n<p>What's happening to the mulvitverse!?!</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
